    "body": "`close()` actually rejects if `open()` is not finished yet in Chromium implementation.\r\n\r\n```js\r\ndevice.open();\r\ndevice.close();\r\n// Promise {<rejected>: DOMException: An operation that changes the device state is in progress.}\r\n```\r\n\r\nResolving `close()` while the device is actually not accessible seems weird to me.\r\n",
    "created_at": "2021-11-17T10:46:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-11-17T10:46:26Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/whatwg/hid/pull/84#discussion_r751119041",
